    "body": "To update the proposal: Rather than extending `required` it would make more sense to introduce `inform` to exist alongside `required` and `allowed`. The proposal suggests to **inform** the server a password was generated rather than **require** generation. This naming makes things more clear.\r\n\r\nAlso tagging @dbates-wk as the original passwordrules author.",
